  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently Udon is missing a node to be able to change the Render Mode (Screen Space Camera, Screen Space - Overlay, etc.) on a Canvas.\n\nBeing able to change the render mode during runtime would help making UI elements that would work efficiently for both VR and desktop. One example would be to change the render mode accordingly to what the player is using (VR or desktop), so if a desktop player joins a world containing a thirdperson camera system they'll be able to see UI elements weither they are in firstperson or in thirdperson.",
